#: scenario2:scenario2_06F5E9DF_EEC6_449D_867F_7CCC7B9DBC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6d01eaf3bf471cab75b2c2f4be81b3de803ebc29b19264b706dce53e0b31169
